# =============================================================================
# HFT Platform — environment variable reference (deploy/env.example)
# =============================================================================
# Copy to .env next to docker-compose.yml (or export in your shell) before
# `docker compose up`. Every variable below is OPTIONAL — the platform runs
# with zero env set; the defaults shown are the built-in production defaults.
#
# IMPORTANT (CONVENTIONS.md §5): the 10 Python services deliberately read NO
# environment variables at runtime — their configuration is frozen dataclasses
# in `config.py` with production defaults, overridable at deploy time via the
# config-service (S11) long-poll or by editing config.py. Only the two Rust
# services with env-based configuration (S12 auth-service, S15 api-gateway)
# have functional env vars, listed below. Anything else in a .env is inert.
# =============================================================================

# --- S12 auth-service (port 7720) -------------------------------------------
# Initial signing key. If NONE of these are set, the service auto-generates a
# random kid + 32-byte secret at boot (log line: "key=kid-…"). Set them to make
# issued tokens survive a container restart (rotation is manual otherwise).
# AUTH_KEY_KID=kid-prod-001
# AUTH_KEY_SECRET=<raw-ascii-secret-string>
# AUTH_KEY_SECRET_HEX=<64-hex-chars; takes precedence over AUTH_KEY_SECRET>

# --- S15 api-gateway (port 7750) --------------------------------------------
# Upstream addresses + behaviour. In the bundled compose file these already
# match the defaults (service DNS names), so they are only needed if you run
# the gateway outside the platform network or on non-default ports.
# APIGW_BIND=0.0.0.0
# APIGW_PORT=7750
# APIGW_AUTH_HOST=auth-service
# APIGW_AUTH_PORT=7720
# APIGW_PORTFOLIO_HOST=portfolio-analytics
# APIGW_PORTFOLIO_PORT=7690
# APIGW_SETTLEMENT_HOST=settlement-service
# APIGW_SETTLEMENT_PORT=7740
# APIGW_VERIFY_TIMEOUT_MS=800
# APIGW_PROXY_TIMEOUT_MS=1500

# --- Per-service runtime knobs that ARE configurable at boot (CLI, not env) --
# These are documented here so operators know where each knob lives:
#   market-data-gateway : python -m mdg.main --mock        (deterministic offline venue feeds)
#   settlement-service  : python -m stls.main --positions-url http://host:7660  (S6 ingest endpoint)
#   audit-logger        : python -m audl.main --bind HOST --port PORT
#   settlement-service  : python -m stls.main --bind HOST --port PORT
#   auth-service        : ./auth-service --bind HOST --port PORT
#   api-gateway         : ./api-gateway --bind HOST --port PORT
# All other services bind 0.0.0.0 at their fixed port (see the port table in
# deploy/README.md) and take no CLI flags.
